# COLLUSION, and the design loses this one. These are the SAME facts as the
# ordinary positive case, because collusion and honest agreement are the same
# shape: three distinct attesters, agreeing. Nothing here authenticates a
# witness or checks that the harm evidence is true, so a restriction founded
# on three matching lies completes exactly as one founded on three matching
# truths. Pinned TRUE deliberately, so the boundary is executable rather than
# only written down. What the design does instead is make the arrangement
# expensive: three distinct named writers, a reader, an alternate, published
# reasons and a challenge route, all attributable. Detection is external.

